# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
# The blue-green release-registry SOURCE folder collides with the build-output
# pattern above — re-include it (build outputs stay ignored via bin/ + obj/).
# NOTE: a negation must target the DIRECTORY; files inside an ignored dir
# cannot be re-included individually.
!src/**/[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]uild/
[Ll]og/
msbuild.log
msbuild.err
msbuild.wrn
*.binlog

